abstract: >-
  A curated, provenance-tracked corpus of half-Heusler lattice thermal
  conductivity in which laboratory measurements and first-principles transport
  calculations are tiered separately and never pooled, together with a
  two-parameter transfer function that maps a published Boltzmann-transport
  calculation onto the experimental scale. Published calculations exceed measured
  values by a median factor of 1.55; within a declared domain of applicability the
  correction places 86.8 per cent of held-out compounds within a factor of two of
  measurement under leave-one-chemistry-out validation.

keywords:
